  "description": "The Grandurance FB 10 brings flatbar agility to the all-road world, delivering confident control on gravel tracks. Its alloy frame and riveted carbon fork give the bike a precise, responsive feel, while the extended-reach flatbar geometry offers stability and composure on technical sections.\n\nWith 45 mm Schwalbe G-One R tires, you get impressive grip and comfort whether you're heading off-grid for adventure. Shimano's Cues 11 speed drivetrain keeps shifting simple and reliable on varied terrain, supported by powerful hydraulic disc brakes for consistent control in changing conditions.\n\nEquipped with wide handlebars for extra leverage and confidence, the Grandurance FB 10 balances speed, comfort and off-road fun – a flatbar gravel bike made to take on new routes and escape the ordinary.",
